  "details": "couldn't find a canny for this so i'm making one for this\na toggle in the quick menu for turning off chairs in the world, maybe even for avatars? could have separate toggles for world chairs and avatar chairs or a button that cycles between these states\nfeature would be useful so you don't need to walk to the world toggles just to toggle off chairs so you don't accidentally sit on them. \nsome worlds don't even have chair toggles but have like 2000 chairs you can accidentally sit on at any moment if you're in VR\naccidentally sitting in chairs in worlds is a huge problem that happens to everyone!",
